      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "It transpires from the record that the present  acquittal appeal has been filed by the State / appell  against the acquittal of respondent / accused under Section 14(A)(1) of the SC/ST Prevention of Atrocities Act, 1989 vide judgment dated 17.10.2022 passed by the Court of learned Special Judge under SC & ST (Prevention of Atrocities) Act, 1989,\nRaipur, District- Raipur (C.G.) in Special Criminal Case No. 06/2020, whereby the appellant has been acquitted under the said section and convicted under Section 376 of the IPC for 10 years rigorous imprisonment. The respondent / accused has also preferred an appeal against his conviction under Section 376 of the IPC bearing CRA No. 607/2024.",
